      "text": "Cover photograph showing a health worker's hand holding a mobile phone out to a seated woman wearing a yellow floral headscarf, who is looking at the phone screen. Behind her, a man wearing a white cap and light blue shirt looks toward the phone, and a young child is seated beside him. The setting appears to be an indoor clinic or community health space with a patterned wall visible in the background.",
